<title>CHINA: Chlor-Alkali first half exports $20.16.</title>
<headline>Chlor-Alkali first half exports $20.16.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Chlor-Alkali Chemical Co Ltd's chemicals output reached record levels during the first half of the year with export income at $20.16 million, the Shanghai Securities News said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The newspaper gave no comparative figures for export income and did not say how profitable exports were.</p>
<p>The company's first-half output of polyvinl chloride topped 100,000 tonnes for the first time while caustic soda output stood at 147,000 tonnes. It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>Chlor-Alkali exported 44,000 tonnes of caustic soda and 12,000 tonnes of PVC during the period.</p>
